<title>POLAND: BOS JULY NET RISES TO PLN 6.7 MLN.</title>
<headline>BOS JULY NET RISES TO PLN 6.7 MLN.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Preliminary results July</p>
<p>(in million zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p> JULY						  1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					  6.66 vs    4.01</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				    8.05 vs    6.60</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		 16.91 vs   11.09</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues	22.64 vs   20.15</p>
<p> JANUARY-JULY					1997	 1996</p>
<p> Net profit					 43.86 vs   22.43</p>
<p> Pre-tax profit				   68.60 vs   41.28</p>
<p> Profit on banking operations		109.62 vs   73.44</p>
<p> Interest and other related revenues     143.80 vs  137.31</p>
<p>Note. Full name of the Polish bank is Bank Ochrony Srodowiska</p>
<p>SA.</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
